      "settings": {
        "subheading": "How Does Taskrabbit Work?",
        "title": "",
        "content": "<p>After purchasing your new William Wood product, you will notice that we provide options for <strong>professional furniture assembly / mirror mounting services</strong> via Taskrabbit on your post purchase confirmation email. Click on one of the provided links and enter your full address to find all the available Taskers in your area.</p><p>Please note that whilst you may be able to book a Tasker to assemble / mount your new William Wood products on the same day as we deliver, we advise you to book your Tasker for the next day to avoid any timing issues.</p><p>Simply click the link below, add your full address and you will be shown all the furniture assembly Taskers available in your area.</p>",
        "button_text": "",
