        "question_BE3Ft": {
          "type": "question",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long do tasks take?",
            "answer": "<p>Time can vary according to how many products you require mounting / assembling – a single mirror / coffee table will usually take less than one hour to mount / assemble.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_gitjY": {
          "type": "question",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "title": "How much do tasks cost?",
            "answer": "<p>The cost of mounting / assembling your William Wood product will depend on the Tasker you choose from Taskrabbit – their prices will be listed when you enter your address, and you can choose the best price for your budget. Taskers bill on an hourly basis and you will receive a final bill once the job has been complete based on the time taken.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_4XnLJ": {
          "type": "question",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "title": "What products apply?",
            "answer": "<p>We offer occasional furniture, some of which are delivered flat packed. Should you wish, you can use Taskrabbit taskers to build the flat packed furniture for you. Please note, some of our occasional furniture does not require assembly. To identify which products do not require assembly, please look out for this icon on the product page \"Delivered fully assembled for your convenience\". </p><p>We offer an extensive range of mirrors. Should you wish, you can use Taskrabbit taskers to mount your mirror(s) on your wall for you.</p><p>Taskrabbit has Taskers capable of assembling / mounting a wide range of furniture / mirrors. Taskers will follow all instructions provided.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_rizFg": {
          "type": "question",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Dont's",
            "answer": "<ul><li>Book a Tasker until you have taken receipt of your order.</li><li>Book a Tasker until you have confirmed you are satisfied with the quality of your item(s).</li><li>Book an assembly service for furniture which does not require assembly (please look out for the icon above on the product). Note: Trays, Vases & Lamps <strong>DO NOT</strong> require an assembly service.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "question_F9xDk": {
          "type": "question",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Terms and Conditions",
            "answer": "<ul><li>Taskrabbit is the preferred partner of William Wood for furniture assembly / mirror mounting.</li><li>Before arranging an appointment via Taskrabbit, please ensure that you are happy to abide by the <a href=\"https://www.taskrabbit.co.uk/privacy\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">terms and conditions</span></a> set by Taskrabbit.</li><li>William Wood is not responsible for any issues caused by third parties, including missed or late appointments, damages or required repairs. Any such instances can be taken up separately with Taskrabbit.</li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Partner Disclosure</strong></p><p>You are welcome to use any supplier for your assembly, but William Wood have chosen a trusted supplier so you can be assured of satisfaction. William Wood will earn a small commission if you choose Taskrabbit for your assembly.</p>"
          }
        }
